  - Do not promote R4 / CAP-NLM-FRAME-CHOICE into default Grade-9 completion or exit-readiness
    scope.
  - Do not add circular-motion / centripetal-force dynamics under Issue 125.
  - Do not create learner mastery state, readiness scores, or a second truth store.
